 方程$x^2+x+3=0$的所有实数解；(2) 比较难的数学题；(3) 一部分末位是3的自然数；(4) 太阳、2、上海市．","evidenceIds":["ev:book-1:L001:example-1:001"],"textFidelity":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"解 (1) 是集合，因为方程没有实数解，所以这个集合是$\\varnothing$．","evidenceIds":["ev:book-1:L001:example-1:002"],"textFidelity":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"(2) “比较难”不确定，不能组成集合．","evidenceIds":["ev:book-1:L001:example-1:003"],"textFidelity":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"(3) “一部分”不确定，不能组成集合；如果确定地告知是哪一部分末位是3的自然数组成的整体，如：末位是3的两位自然数组成的整体，则可以组成集合．","evidenceIds":["ev:book-1:L001:example-1:004"],"textFidelity":"source_based_reconstruction"},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"(4) 是集合，一些对象只要是确定的就能组成集合，如本题这个集合含有3个元素，分别是太阳，一个数2，和一个城市上海，符合定义．因此与集合中元素是否是一类的或者一定要具有共同特征无关，即使是截然不同的对象，只要是确定的都可以组成一个集合．","evidenceIds":["ev:book-1:L001:example-1:005"],"textFidelity":"source_based_reconstruction"}],"matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"对应现有节点所指概念或任务；不创建新节点。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book-1:L001:example-1:000","sourceId":"L001","sourceSha256":"07741f46039182b079e6703f3888f044284fb5b4f1715cd8d7beb06008e4bc5e","locator":{"headingPath":["例1 判断对象能否组成集合"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":4,"pdfPage":null,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null,"renderVariant":"original-fontconfig"},"quote":"判断下列各组对象能否组成集合","sourceSupportedTranscription":"例1请判断下列各组对象能否组成集合，请说明理由．","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L001","requestedPath":"increments/batch01-v1/evidence/L001/page-4.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L001.docx","sourceTitle":"1.1集合初步（1）教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book-1:L001:example-1:001","sourceId":"L001","sourceSha256":"07741f46039182b079e6703f3888f044284fb